                        "review": "I received this game for free but I can't recommend it for an expensive 20 euro. The sale price is still far too high compared to the quality and content the game offers. Developers promising additional campaigns. If it ever happens then I might review my recommendation.\n\nIf you a visual type here is a video about the features of the game:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/dAQJuqPp16M\n\nBattle Fleet: Ground Assault is a turn-based strategy game. I know that most players don't like a wall of texts, so I try to make my reasons to shorter but easy to understand sentences.\n\nCONS:\n\n-Outdated graphics for a game released in 2018 and with a price tag of 20eur.\n-Only one campaign. Too few provinces which result in the short completion of the game.\n-Strategy games usually have high replay value. My opinion is that this game is an exception.\n-Multiplayer is dead. Hot Seat mode is unplayable for local coop as the turns not divided for factions, its divided to units. It means that after a US tank the next could be an Axis tank, then again a US tank. It would require way too many player changes while they can see each other locations because of the frequent player change.\n-Unrealistic strategy game. Tanks or Panzers vulnerable without the support of infantries. Additionally, this war cant simplified only to tank vs tank battles. Germans had much better panzers, but the war was decided by the air force.\n-Weak AI, it never uses the explosive ammo for collateral damage.\n-The game could be called only as a casual strategy game.\n\n¶▅c●▄███████||▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅▅||█~ ::~ :~ :► \n▄██ ▲  █ █ ██▅▄▃▂ \n███▲ ▲ █ █ ███████ \n███████████████████████► \n◥☼▲⊙▲⊙▲⊙▲⊙▲⊙▲⊙▲⊙☼◤\n\nPros:\n-Custom battle available if you want some tank vs tank gunnery action\n-buildings, trees could be destroyed\n-sound effects during battles are great.\n-ammo or loot boxes can be found during battles. Each of these reward one useable card to enhance your offensive or defensive tactic.\n\n[b]Hey, I am an achievement hunter! [/b]\n\nThe achievements in this game require you to kill units. Nothing hard about, it just takes time. However, if you want to get it done as fast as possible here are some instructions:\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1659958852\n\n[b]This review was created for Average Achievement Hunter curator [/b]\n\nFollow my curator if you like to see achievement related information (completion time, difficulty to get all achievements) on store page of the games.\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/curator/30168383-Average-Achievement-Hunter/ \n\nThe curator group doesn't mark any game as recommended so it shows useful information about achievements on the store page of the games without influencing the main store page of steam with recommendations + all games sorted to lists based on expected completion times. No point not to follow!:-)",
